Shami stores [[Beastmen's Seal|Beastmen's Seals]], [[Kindred's Seal|Kindred's Seals]], [[Kindred's Crest|Kindred's Crests]], [[High Kindred's Crest|High Kindred's Crests]], and [[Sacred Kindred's Crest|Sacred Kindred's Crests]], and can also exchange these for orbs that are needed to enter [[:category:BCNM|BCNMs]], [[KSNM|KSNMs]], [[:Category:KCNM|KCNMs]], [[HKCNM|HKCNMs]], and [[:Category:SKCNM|SKCNMs]] throughout the realm.

===Storing Seals and Crests===

* Trade Shami any number of Seals or Crests to store them.
* You may trade all types of Seals and/or Crests to Shami at the same time (as of the September 2019 update).
* After the trade, he will tell you the new balance of all the types of Seals and/or Crests that you traded.
** You can also check your balance for these by talking to [[Shemo]], who is standing beside Shami, or at any time by checking [[Main Menu]] > Status > Currencies.
*You may retrieve Seals or Crests (up to 99 at a time) from Shami for use in [[Fields of Valor]] elite training regimes, [[Limit Break]] quests, [[:Category:Trial of the Magians|Magian Trials]], or certain gear upgrades.

=== Obtaining Orbs ===
*You must store your Seals and Crests with Shami before you can use them to obtain orbs.
*To obtain an orb, you need to know which Seal or Crest you need for that orb, and select the option to Exchange that type of Seal or Crest.  He will then list the orbs that are available for that type of Seal or Crest, and their costs.
*If at any time you are wondering if an orb in your inventory has been used or not, you can trade said orb to Shami.
**If the orb ''has'' ''not'' been used, he will say something along the lines of "Just bring this orb to a burning circle ... and 'poof!' instant monster."
**If the orb ''has'' already been used, he will say "Oh dear! I see a crack here. It's worthless now, so I'll dispose of it. But, I've still got more!" The used orb will then be removed from your inventory.

